---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Tenda Peppers"
  description="Tenda Peppers privacy policy — how we handle contact and inquiry information."
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-08-31</em></p>
    <p>
      Tenda Peppers (Leling Tenda Chili Products Co., Ltd.) respects your privacy. This site is a
      B2B information and inquiry platform. We do not sell personal data.
    </p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you contact us by email or WhatsApp, we receive the information you choose to share
      (such as your name, company, email and inquiry details). We use this solely to respond to
      your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Inquiry correspondence is retained only as long as needed to complete the business
      transaction and any related obligations, after which it is deleted or anonymized.
    </p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:24px;">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:joanna@paprikabulk.com">joanna@paprikabulk.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
